{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.luca.cafe",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "站前的喫茶店里，她一个人坐着",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.luca.cafe",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.luca.cafe",
    "idolId": "luca",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "站前的喫茶店。靠窗那桌只有一个人，面前的杯子早就空了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……找到你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "滚。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "没人叫你。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是我自己来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天你本来该来事务所的。……要来的时候，能给个信就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……饮品单。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "你每次……都点的那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "你喜欢的那个…………",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………现在没了────────",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "明明还挺喜欢的。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………明明挺喜欢的────────",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………回去吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "你自己回去啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "反正，也没什么像样的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……ルカ，有工作找上门了。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我想跟你商量。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……………",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……什么样的。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "小型 live。场地不大，但是和音乐媒体一起做，来看的人会很挑。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……那种的，我接。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……真的？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "别问第二遍。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……知道了。那我去回话。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "text": "她站起来的时候，椅子腿在地板上刮了一声。杯子还放在桌上，她没管。"
      }
    }
  },
